---
description: SurfCAD UI text, color, and type — follow the shared style guide
globs: src/**/*.{js,jsx,css}
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow [docs/ui-style-guide.md](docs/ui-style-guide.md).

- Use `surface-*`, `text-on-*`, `text-muted-on-*`, `font-ui` — no ad-hoc hex or Tailwind color utilities in components.
- Never black or dark text on dark chrome / dark blue (`bg-chrome-surface` is dark). Dark surfaces use `text-on-dark`.
- WCAG AA: 4.5:1 body, 3:1 large text and icons.
- User-facing copy says Chrome, never Microsoft Edge.
- New color: token on `:root` first, then a class.
- Do not restyle `src/fea/**`.
